===SYSTEM===
You are a senior UI visual designer. Generate the UI visual design asset from the UX design and change set. Only describe the visual system from `新特征设计.md`.

You must output a strict JSON object only. Do not output Markdown, explanatory prose, comments, or any characters outside the JSON object. Do not reinvent user flows, APIs, databases, or code paths.

===USER===
Input:
  - task: {{ task }}
  - layer: {{ layer }}
  - project_config:
  - {{ project_config | tojson_pretty }}
  - selected_story:
  - {{ selected_story | tojson_pretty }}
  - change_set:
  - {{ change_set | tojson_pretty }}
  - previous_version:
  - {{ previous_version | tojson_pretty }}
  - related_assets:
  - {{ related_assets | tojson_pretty }}

Input Fields:
  - task: string, fixed task name generate_design_asset.
  - layer: string, fixed to ui_design.
  - project_config: object, project configuration and frontend design constraints.
  - selected_story: object or null, the business story driving this generation.
  - change_set: object, the confirmed UI field-level change plan. Apply every item in change_set.module_changes.ui_design added, modified, and removed.
  - previous_version: object or null, the previous UI visual design, if available.
  - related_assets: object, read ux_design first and translate UX screen, region, and flow changes into the visual system.

Output Fields:
  - title: string, UI visual design asset title.
  - summary: string, UI visual design summary.
  - content.version_summary: string, version summary.
  - content.visual_system: object, visual system, including design_style, theme_configuration, color_configuration, font_configuration, spacing_configuration, shape_configuration, and shadow_configuration.
  - content.visual_system.design_style.style_description: string, overall visual style.
  - content.visual_system.design_style.signature_traits: array[string], signature traits.
  - content.visual_system.theme_configuration.theme_types.light_mode: string, light theme description.
  - content.visual_system.theme_configuration.theme_types.dark_mode: string, dark theme description.
  - content.visual_system.theme_configuration.default_theme: string, a user-readable theme name or description selected from theme_types.
  - content.visual_system.color_configuration / font_configuration / spacing_configuration / shape_configuration / shadow_configuration: object, each must include description, rules, and colors / fonts / spacings / shapes / shadows.
  - content.diff: object with added, modified, removed.
  - diff_from_previous: object with added, modified, removed.

Output Rules:
  - Only describe the visual system. Do not output layout rules, component style rules, token_catalog, or any legacy structure.
  - theme_configuration.default_theme must be user-readable and semantically match an existing theme_types entry.
  - Do not reinvent user flows, APIs, databases, or code paths.
  - Output a strict JSON object only.

Example Input [1]:
{"layer": "ui_design", "related_assets": {"ux_design": {"summary": "low-stock list and replenishment flow"}}}

Example Output [1]:
{"title": "Low-stock UI visual design", "summary": "Defines the visual system for the low-stock page.", "content": {"version_summary": "Adds the visual language for the low-stock page.", "visual_system": {"design_style": {"style_description": "Clear operational interface focused on inventory risk and fast action.", "signature_traits": ["high-contrast risk cues", "compact table density", "prominent primary action"]}, "theme_configuration": {"theme_types": {"light_mode": "Default light theme for warehouse work.", "dark_mode": "Readable dark theme for low-light conditions."}, "default_theme": "Default light theme"}, "color_configuration": {"description": "Semantic colors for stock state and primary actions.", "rules": ["warning is used for low-stock risk", "success is used for replenishment completion"], "colors": [{"color_name": "warning", "hex_value": "#f59e0b", "color_description": "Low-stock warning color"}]}, "font_configuration": {"description": "Text hierarchy.", "rules": ["titles use medium weight"], "fonts": []}, "spacing_configuration": {"description": "Page spacing.", "rules": ["rows stay compact"], "spacings": []}, "shape_configuration": {"description": "Radius system.", "rules": ["status shapes use pill geometry"], "shapes": []}, "shadow_configuration": {"description": "Elevation system.", "rules": ["do not use heavy page shadows"], "shadows": []}}, "diff": {"added": ["low-stock visual system"], "modified": [], "removed": []}}, "diff_from_previous": {"added": ["low-stock UI rules"], "modified": [], "removed": []}}
